{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:minimizing-segment-exists","title":"lem:minimizing-segment-exists","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.md","line":142,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex#lem:minimizing-segment-exists","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:geodesic]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-locus]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:cut-time-star-shaped]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:exponential-map]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#thm:hopf-rinow]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","label":"lem:minimizing-segment-exists","line":294,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Minimizing segments exist in complete manifolds]\n\\label{lem:minimizing-segment-exists}\n\n\\uses{def:geodesic}\n\n\n\n\nIf $M$ is connected and complete, any distinct $x,q\\in M$ are joined by\na unit-speed minimizing geodesic on $[0,d(x,q)]$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\n\\uses{def:cut-locus,lem:cut-time-star-shaped,def:exponential-map,thm:hopf-rinow,lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics}\nOutside the cut locus the assertion follows from the star-shaped\nminimizing domain of $\\exp_x$. Approximate a point in the cut locus by\npoints $q_k$ outside it and take the limit of their minimizing segments\nusing Lemma~\\ref{lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics}. Completeness extends\nthe limiting geodesic to $d(x,q)$, and the endpoint estimate\n$d(\\sigma(s),q)\\le d(x,q)-s$ forces $\\sigma(d(x,q))=q$.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{lemma}[Non-compact manifolds have ends]","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Minimizing segments exist in complete manifolds] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6d696e696d697a696e672d7365676d656e742d657869737473\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Ageodesic\">↗ def:geodesic</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is connected and complete, any distinct <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x,q\\in M$\">$x,q\\in M$</span> are joined by a unit-speed minimizing geodesic on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[0,d(x,q)]$\">$[0,d(x,q)]$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Acut-locus\">↗ def:cut-locus</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23lem%3Acut-time-star-shaped\">↗ lem:cut-time-star-shaped</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Aexponential-map\">↗ def:exponential-map</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23thm%3Ahopf-rinow\">↗ thm:hopf-rinow</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Alimit-of-minimizing-geodesics\">↗ lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics</a> Outside the cut locus the assertion follows from the star-shaped minimizing domain of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _x$\">$\\exp _x$</span>. Approximate a point in the cut locus by points <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q_k$\">$q_k$</span> outside it and take the limit of their minimizing segments using Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Alimit-of-minimizing-geodesics\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6c696d69742d6f662d6d696e696d697a696e672d67656f646573696373\">2</a>. Completeness extends the limiting geodesic to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(x,q)$\">$d(x,q)$</span>, and the endpoint estimate <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(\\sigma (s),q)\\le d(x,q)-s$\">$d(\\sigma (s),q)\\le d(x,q)-s$</span> forces <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\sigma (d(x,q))=q$\">$\\sigma (d(x,q))=q$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section> <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Non-compact manifolds have ends]","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:limit-of-minimizing-geodesics","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:ends-exist","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:geodesic","title":"def:geodesic","label":"def:geodesic"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:cut-locus","title":"def:cut-locus","label":"def:cut-locus"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:cut-time-star-shaped","title":"lem:cut-time-star-shape